OpenStreetMap attribution
=========================

This project reverse-geocodes photo GPS coordinates into place-name text
(city/town + country) via Nominatim and, as a fallback, Photon. Both use
OpenStreetMap data. No map tiles are shown.

Place names are insubstantial extracts under the OpenStreetMap Foundation
Geocoding Guideline; ODbL share-alike is not triggered. The application still
credits OpenStreetMap (ODbL §4.3 / Attribution Guidelines).

Credit shown to the viewer: a brief splash on the slideshow loading screen.
