Optional clock fonts
====================

Self-hosted Manrope, Inter, Outfit, and Figtree (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
live under fonts/ (latin + latin-ext). See fonts/README.txt and fonts/OFL-*.txt.
Default clock face remains the system stack until configured.
